        type: "para",
        text: "In conclusion, it may be said that physical exercise is the key to a healthy, active and happy life. It keeps the body fit, the mind fresh and the character strong. A nation of weak and sickly people can never be great. If we want to build a strong and prosperous Bangladesh, we must all make regular exercise a part of our daily life. Let us remember that a few minutes of exercise every day can save us from many days of illness.",
