        text: "A hobby is a favourite pursuit which a man follows in his leisure hours for the sake of pleasure and not for the sake of money. It is the work that a man loves to do when he is free from the duties of his profession or his studies. Life in the modern age is full of work, worry and monotony. Our minds grow tired of doing the same things day after day. A good hobby gives us recreation and relief from this dull routine and fills our free time with joy and meaning. That is why every man, whether young or old, should have a hobby of his own.",
