        text: "Childhood is the happiest period of human life. It is a time of innocence, joy and freedom, when the mind is free from the cares and anxieties of the world. A child has no worry about earning a living, no fear of failure and no burden of responsibility. He lives in a world of his own, full of play, dreams and wonder. As we grow older, the burdens of life begin to fall upon our shoulders, and we often look back upon our childhood with a sweet pang of nostalgia. When I recollect my own childhood, many happy memories come crowding into my mind.",
