        text: "I spent my early childhood in a small village called Chandpur in the district of Kushtia. Our village was a picture of natural beauty. A narrow river flowed along its side, and there were green paddy fields all around it. Our house had a big pond in front and an orchard of mango, jackfruit and litchi trees behind it. My grandparents, my parents, my uncles and my cousins all lived together in a joint family. The house was always full of noise and laughter, and I was the darling of everyone.",
