        type: "para",
        text: "Students can also fight against social evils. Dowry, early marriage, superstition, gambling, drug addiction and violence against women are still common in our society. Students can hold meetings, arrange dramas and rallies, and make people aware of the harmful effects of these evils. They can also plant trees, protect the environment and help the police in controlling traffic in times of need. Many students donate blood regularly through voluntary organisations like Sandhani and save the lives of patients who would otherwise die.",
