        type: "para",
        text: "In conclusion, it may be said that the computer is one of the greatest wonders of modern science. It has revolutionised our life and brought speed, efficiency and comfort to every sphere of it. For a developing country like Bangladesh, the proper use of computers is the key to progress. If we can spread computer education throughout the country and make the best use of this wonderful machine, we shall be able to stand side by side with the developed nations of the world.",
