        type: "para",
        text: "The problem of population is closely connected with the problem of education. In an overpopulated country, it is very difficult to provide good education for every child. Many schools have more students than they can teach properly, and the number of qualified teachers is not enough. As a result, the quality of education falls, and many students leave school before completing their studies. Such half-educated young people find it hard to get jobs, and they, in turn, often marry early and have large families. Unless we can give quality education to all our children, the problem of population will remain unsolved.",
