        text: "In conclusion, it may be said that our cultural heritage is the soul of our nation. It gives us our identity and makes us different from other nations of the world. It is a legacy left to us by our ancestors, and it is our duty to preserve it and pass it on to our future generations. If we forget our culture, we shall lose ourselves. Let us, therefore, love, practise and protect our rich cultural heritage.",
