        type: "para",
        text: "To reduce road accidents, a number of steps must be taken. Drivers must be properly trained, and licences must be given only after strict tests. Unfit vehicles must be removed from the roads, and overloading must be stopped. The roads and highways should be widened and repaired, and dangerous bends should be straightened. Separate lanes should be made for slow vehicles. The traffic laws must be enforced strictly and without favour, and heavy penalties should be imposed on those who break them. Modern equipment like speed cameras should be introduced on the highways.",
