        text: "The effects of child labour are very harmful. Working for long hours in unhealthy and dangerous places ruins the health of children. Many of them suffer from malnutrition, lung diseases, skin diseases and injuries, and their growth is stunted. They are deprived of education and so remain illiterate for the rest of their lives. They are also vulnerable to abuse. Many child domestic workers are beaten, starved and tortured by their employers, and such news often appears in the newspapers. Some children fall into bad company and become involved in crime and drug addiction.",
