        type: "para",
        text: "Near the monastery there is a small museum, which we visited next. It contains many artefacts unearthed from the site, such as stone and bronze images, terracotta plaques, coins, inscriptions, pots and ornaments. Our teacher explained the history of each object to us, and we took notes in our diaries. We also saw an ancient bathing ghat just outside the walls of the monastery. Before leaving, we took many photographs as a memory of our visit.",
