        type: "para",
        text: "The visit taught me many things that I could never have learnt from books alone. It gave me a clear idea about the history, culture and art of ancient Bengal. It showed me that our ancestors were highly civilised and cultured people. It also taught me the importance of preserving the relics of the past, for a nation that forgets its history cannot build its future.",
